{"sha":"0629f24672ed98a8583580fc825bb2c056d3f212","node_id":"C_kwDOBCRpgtoAKDA2MjlmMjQ2NzJlZDk4YTg1ODM1ODBmYzgyNWJiMmMwNTZkM2YyMTI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Ruben Pari","email":"rubenpari.developer@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-23T14:58:48Z"},"committer":{"name":"Antonio Tripodi","email":"Tony133@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-24T10:36:24Z"},"message":"fix(types): add logSerializers to RouteShorthandOptions\n\nThe runtime accepts logSerializers as a per-route option\n(lib/route.js) and it is documented under the shared options in\ndocs/Reference/Routes.md, but RouteShorthandOptions did not include\nit. The serializers are passed as pino child logger bindings, so the\nreturn type is widened to match pino serializer semantics: serializer\nfunctions may return objects as well as strings.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 5c1f3935e43b35679c71ea7a65275a348d1efbd1)","tree":{"sha":"ad5c05a7fb76c86c1864061e68f380d1bf77f0b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/git/trees/ad5c05a7fb76c86c1864061e68f380d1bf77f0b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/git/commits/0629f24672ed98a8583580fc825bb2c056d3f212","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/commits/0629f24672ed98a8583580fc825bb2c056d3f212","html_url":"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/commit/0629f24672ed98a8583580fc825bb2c056d3f212","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/commits/0629f24672ed98a8583580fc825bb2c056d3f212/comments","author":{"login":"RubenPari","id":73421813,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNDIxODEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73421813?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RubenPari","html_url":"https://github.com/RubenPari","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RubenPari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RubenPari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":